  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p>예전에 포스코에서 공익광고처럼 올렸던 영상입니다. Fe 외우기에 좋아요</p><p><iframe id=\"vd374UzUWsvUP0ZPWqpZqWR\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/vd374UzUWsvUP0ZPWqpZqWR?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZkMzc0VXpVV3N2VVAwWlBXcXBacVdSIiwidGlkIjoiYjEzMzA2YmYtNzA4My00MWNhLTgxZTItNDE5NTZkZTMwMGUxIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTgzNDk2fQ.P5AcPfPFsOJZrJ_n7Q3wrIE455UGmfj4oYJUhE88TDyhioeqPnb0VhxSOAUrze_VwMKvH36uVDDzvpSCu7el0g&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"vb7d7M3J5J5J3zAOW7Fs7WO\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/vb7d7M3J5J5J3zAOW7Fs7WO?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZiN2Q3TTNKNUo1SjN6QU9XN0ZzN1dPIiwidGlkIjoiNjZmOTFhZDktN2E0OC00Y2QyLTlmOGUtNTI2YmY0ODQ3MWFkIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTgzNDk2fQ.YxRYtLWDZUTSMyFtKAwR2GxLtDb-aKyYTC9QwNDCZcYhjQG0WUGbkLXwytAataVB5oMh6ahwsMHvqZh9wsaIhQ&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p>&nbsp;</p></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
